@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex: <http://ex.org/> .
<http://ex.org/o> a owl:Ontology .
ex:A a owl:Class . ex:p a owl:ObjectProperty .
ex:a a owl:NamedIndividual . ex:c1 a owl:NamedIndividual . ex:c2 a owl:NamedIndividual .
ex:c1 owl:differentFrom ex:c2 .
ex:a ex:p ex:c1 . ex:a ex:p ex:c2 .
ex:A owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ex:p ; owl:minCardinality "2"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ] .
